@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "诊疗助理" as A0
boundary "<u>:诊疗助理接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:登记器械包使用</u>\n<u>与追溯控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:就诊</u>" as Visit
participant "<u>:器械处理</u>" as Process
participant "<u>:器械包处理</u>" as PackCycle
participant "<u>:器械使用</u>" as InstrumentUse
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-31办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-31办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Visit : 核对使用归属(实际就诊)
activate Visit
Visit --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Visit
K -> Process : 核对包次可用性(指定包次、有效期及实物依据)
activate Process
Process -> PackCycle : 核对本轮可用性(放行结论、未使用及包装)
activate PackCycle
PackCycle --> Process : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate PackCycle
Process -> PackCycle : 登记发放(本轮包次、实物核对及就诊)
activate PackCycle
PackCycle --> Process : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate PackCycle
Process --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Process
K -> Process : 登记本轮使用(就诊、包次和实际核对)
activate Process
Process -> PackCycle : 登记实际使用(实际使用时间与就诊)
activate PackCycle
PackCycle -> InstrumentUse : 保留使用关联(本轮处理和经办人)
activate InstrumentUse
InstrumentUse --> PackCycle : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate InstrumentUse
PackCycle --> Process : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate PackCycle
Process --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Process
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,InstrumentUse
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
